msgstr "Guide"

#: apps/seo/package_views.py:22
msgid "What is dental tourism?"
msgstr "Hvad er tandturisme?"

#: apps/seo/package_views.py:23
msgid ""
"Dental tourism means travelling to another country for dental treatment — "
"usually to combine experienced dentists, modern clinics and significantly "
"lower costs with a short trip."
msgstr ""
"Tandturisme betyder at rejse til et andet land for tandbehandling – som "
"regel for at kombinere erfarne tandlæger, moderne klinikker og markant "
"lavere omkostninger med en kort rejse."

#: apps/seo/package_views.py:25
msgid "What is included in a dental tourism package?"
msgstr "Hvad indgår i en tandturismepakke?"

#: apps/seo/package_views.py:26
msgid ""
"A personal assessment, 3D scan and examination in Istanbul, the treatment "
"itself and aftercare via WhatsApp when you are back home. Instead of "
"bundling extras, we put your budget into your treatment plan — and more "
"affordable options are available too."
msgstr ""
"En personlig vurdering, 3D-scanning og undersøgelse i Istanbul, selve "
"behandlingen og efterbehandling via WhatsApp, når du er hjemme igen. I "
"stedet for at lægge ekstraydelser oven i investerer vi dit budget i din "
"behandlingsplan — og der findes også billigere muligheder."

#: apps/seo/package_views.py:29
msgid "Why is a personalised package better value?"
msgstr "Hvorfor giver en personlig pakke mere for pengene?"

#: apps/seo/package_views.py:30
msgid ""
"Because you pay for your treatment, not for extras. Your budget goes into "
"the dentist's time, quality materials and a result that lasts — and more "
"affordable options are available too. Ask us on WhatsApp."
msgstr ""
"Fordi du betaler for din behandling, ikke for ekstraydelser. Dit budget går "
"til tandlægens tid, kvalitetsmaterialer og et holdbart resultat — og der "
"findes også billigere muligheder. Spørg os på WhatsApp."

#: apps/seo/package_views.py:33
msgid "How much does a dental package cost?"
msgstr "Hvad koster en tandpakke?"

#: apps/seo/package_views.py:34
msgid ""
"We do not sell fixed-price packages, because no two mouths are the same. "
"Send photos or an X-ray on WhatsApp and you receive a personal treatment "
"plan with a fixed written quote."
msgstr ""
"Vi sælger ikke pakker til fast pris, for ingen mund er ens. Send billeder "
"eller røntgen på WhatsApp, så får du en personlig behandlingsplan med "
"skriftlig fast pris."

#: apps/seo/package_views.py:36
msgid "Is an all-inclusive Hollywood smile package a good idea?"
msgstr "Er en all inclusive Hollywood-smil-pakke en god idé?"

#: apps/seo/package_views.py:37
msgid ""
"Only if you actually need it. Packages that sell 20 veneers before anyone "
"has examined your teeth often remove healthy tooth structure. A real plan "
"starts with a diagnosis."
msgstr ""
"Kun hvis du virkelig har brug for den. Pakker, der sælger 20 facader, før "
"nogen har undersøgt dine tænder, fjerner ofte sund tandsubstans. En ægte "
"plan starter med en diagnose."

#: apps/seo/package_views.py:39
msgid "How long does a dental trip to Turkey take?"
msgstr "Hvor lang tid tager en tandrejse til Tyrkiet?"

#: apps/seo/package_views.py:40
msgid ""
"Most treatments take 3–7 days in Istanbul. Implants usually need two short "
"visits a few months apart; we plan both around your flights."
msgstr ""
"De fleste behandlinger tager 3–7 dage i Istanbul. Implantater kræver som "
"regel to korte besøg med nogle måneders mellemrum; vi planlægger begge efter"
" dine fly."

#: apps/seo/package_views.py:62
msgid "Dental Holiday Packages Istanbul 2026 — Planned on Your X-ray"
msgstr "Tandlægerejse Istanbul 2026 — Planlagt efter Dit Røntgen"

#: apps/seo/package_views.py:63
msgid ""
"No one-size-fits-all deal: your dental package in Istanbul is planned from "
"your photos or X-ray, with a fixed written quote and aftercare at home."
msgstr ""
"Ingen standardpakke: din tandbehandling i Istanbul planlægges ud fra dine "
"fotos eller røntgen, med fast skriftligt tilbud og efterbehandling hjemme."

