#: templates/seo/treatment_price.html:23
msgid ""
"Dental work is more than a Hollywood smile. We recommend only what you "
"really need — that is also the most affordable plan."
msgstr ""
"Tandbehandling er mere end et Hollywood-smil. Vi anbefaler kun det, du "
"virkelig har brug for – det er også den mest overkommelige plan."

#: templates/thanks.html:6
